// These are the @wf-qa INDEPENDENT acceptance tests for scan-library (QA-1).
// They re-derive AC-1/AC-3/AC-4/AC-6 from acceptance.md's Given/When/Then
// WITHOUT trusting the coder's mellifera/integration_test.go assertions: the
// fixture filenames, the expected parse values, and the proto-verbatim probe
// are all derived independently here. The golden-test rule (acceptance.md
// "Reviewer independence") is the carve-out that justifies a second e2e over
